 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "How to Live as a Tyrant's Spoiled Brat"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "폭군의 망나니 오빠로 사는 법"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "On the day the empire fell to rebellion and invasion from another world, Valen met his end alongside his sister, the Emperor.  \n\nBut when he opened his eyes again, he found himself 40 years in the past.  \n\nThis time, he vowed to do whatever it took to prevent the world's destruction and protect the Emperor.  \n\nAnd his solution?  \n\nTo live an even wilder life than before.  \n\n\"If I was a scoundrel in my past life, then this time... I'll be the ultimate menace!\""
  },
